% PostScript Data Processing Utility - Main Module
% Entry point for the data processing pipeline.

% Load dependencies
/ingester load def
/transformer load def
/validator load def
/reporter load def

% Initialize data storage
data 0 get dup length string copy /current_data exch def

% Execute pipeline
current_data 
  ingester process 
  transformer apply 
  validator check 
  reporter output 

currentstack pop
